  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Configuration file injection via unescaped carriage\n     returns in ConfigParser.write()\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-0864.patch: normalize CR, CRLF and LF line\n       endings to '\\n\\t' in both value-escaping call sites of\n       RawConfigParser.write() in Lib/ConfigParser.py, so an attacker\n       controlled value can no longer inject unexpected keys into the written\n       file; add regression test to Lib/test/test_cfgparser.py\n     - CVE-2026-0864",
